1.PROJECT TITLE
Plant Disease Image Classification Using Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)

2.PROBLEM STATEMENT
To develop a deep learning system that automatically identifies and classifies plant diseases from leaf images using image processing and a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN).

3. OBJECTIVE
To collect and explore plant leaf image data.
To preprocess the images by resizing and normalizing pixel values.
To identify different plant disease classes.
To build and train a CNN model for plant disease classification.
To evaluate the model using suitable classification metrics.
To predict the disease of a new plant leaf image.

4. AI\ML TYPE
AI/ML: Deep Learning
Learning Type: Supervised Learning
Problem Type: Multiclass Classification
Input/Features: Plant leaf image pixel values
Target: Plant Disease Class
Algorithm: Convolutional Neural Network (CNN)

5. EXPECTED OUTCOMES
To develop a CNN-based classification model that can predict the disease class of a new plant leaf image and evaluate its performance using Accuracy, Precision, Recall, F1-score, and Confusion Matrix.
